:: Start [awakening hub]
<!-- harness:meta
location: cartography_shop
type: hub
-->

You wake at your drafting table, cheek pressed against a half-finished map of the Veilwood. Ink has bled across the parchment in the night, pooling into shapes that should not exist, a river where no river flows, a pass through mountains you have never seen.

Your hands are stained black to the wrist.

<<set $has_discovered_power to false>>
<<set $guild_trust to 5>>
<<set $apprentice_loyalty to 8>>
<<set $maps_drawn to 0>>
<<set $frontier_reached to false>>

You smell ozone and old paper. Something has changed. The maps are not describing the world anymore. They are *prescribing* it.

<<actions [[Examine the bleeding ink|awakening__examine_ink]] [[Check the front door|awakening__front_door]] [[Go back to sleep|awakening__sleep_again]]>>
